  sale_text: "5,000 Mint Passes, max 10 per wallet, paid in USDT. The sale opens Saturday 12 Dec 2026, 12:00 UTC — the first 24 hours are for Prelude registrants only, then it opens to every Agent ID holder. Minting runs 18 days, until the verdict on Wednesday 30 Dec 2026, 12:00 UTC. If all 5,000 Passes have sold by then, the sale has graduated: the pool is seeded (159,500,000 OPUS + 6,300 USDT on PancakeSwap V2, LP burned) and all burn-to-claim opens. If the Passes sell out early, minting simply stops — the pool and claims still wait for the verdict. If even one Pass remains unsold at the verdict, the sale fails and all buyers are refunded 100%.",
  sale_claims: "Claiming OPUS means burning the NFT, one at a time: burn a Pass and choose Premiere (100% at once) or Encore (50% at once, 50% vesting over 60 days, plus an Encore bonus and — on your first Encore claim — a soulbound SCHERZO key NFT: exactly one per wallet, never transferable, the key to a guaranteed Overture seat in Scherzo (the second movement · Season 2, planned) if it opens). ★ Burning is permanent — a burned NFT is destroyed and cannot be recovered.",
